        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "...(Right, I didn’t tell her my name in this loop.)",
        "zh": "......（对了，在这个循环内我没有告诉过她我的名字来着。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
