      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Veris. Nice to meet you.",
        "zh": "何以真，很高兴认识你。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Haha! The pleasure’s all mine!",
        "zh": "哈哈！我才是很高兴认识你呢！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Sorry, though. I’d love to chat more, but I need to head back to the temple and report to my Shifu.",
        "zh": "抱歉哦，虽然我还想跟你多聊一会儿。但我还得赶回道观把事情报告给师父。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "No problem, I should check into my hotel anyway.",
        "zh": "没事，我也差不多该去定好的酒店了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(It feels like so much time has passed, but I actually arrived in Yuntai ahead of schedule.)",
        "zh": "（看似经过了这么久，实际上我到达芸台的时间却比预计提前了。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "By the way, that mirror you have — it’s amazing. Instant teleportation? Unbelievable.",
        "zh": "不过你手里的那个镜子，真是神奇啊，居然能够瞬间移动。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah!",
        "zh": "啊！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Veris, let me tell you a secret—but you must never mention this mirror to anyone else!",
        "zh": "何以真，我偷偷告诉你，你千万不要向别人提起这个镜子哦！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Eh?",
        "zh": "欸？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Hehe! This mirror is called the<color=orange> “Mirror of Clarity.”</color> My Shifu specifically sent me to Wenqiu to retrieve it. It’s actually the final prize in the Craftsmanship Duel segment of this year’s Yuntai Festival!",
        "zh": "嘿嘿！这镜子叫做<color=orange>明镜</color>，可是师父专门派我去纹秋取回来的，它其实是这届芸台大会斗巧环节的最终奖品！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "But it doesn’t allow unlimited teleportation—its range is limited to Yuntai City. I’m not exactly sure why, though.",
        "zh": "不过不是任意移动啦，它的影响范围只限于芸台市区，具体原因我也不太清楚就是了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I see… and your Shifu still let you use it to deal with the incident on the plane…",
        "zh": "这样啊，那你师父后来居然肯让你拿它过来解决飞机上的事......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
